@base_url = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Process is alive, independent of database readiness
GET {{base_url}}/health/live

### Database is reachable and schema revision matches this application
GET {{base_url}}/health/ready

### Unified 404 error and X-Request-ID
GET {{base_url}}/not-found

### Unified 405 error, with Allow header preserved
POST {{base_url}}/health/live
